WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.780 --> 01:30.280
I'm sorry Chocolat-chan,

01:30.280 --> 01:31.980
can you wait for bit?

01:31.980 --> 01:34.150
I'll be done cleaning here soon.

01:34.920 --> 01:35.980
Okay, got it.

01:36.620 --> 01:38.620
I'll be waiting in the inside garden.

01:47.300 --> 01:48.130
Pierre...

01:48.700 --> 01:50.270
The new quarter has just begun,

01:50.270 --> 01:52.250
there's no need to be on cleaning duty.

01:53.640 --> 01:55.090
But I like cleaning.

01:55.840 --> 01:56.540
Although.

01:57.510 --> 01:59.840
I really don't think something like it
is fitting for you.

02:01.680 --> 02:02.540
See you later.

02:04.880 --> 02:05.550
Wait!

02:09.350 --> 02:12.050
Don't get any closer to Chocolat-chan.

02:14.190 --> 02:15.560
Plea... se.

02:31.810 --> 02:34.040
Cleaning isn't becoming of you...

02:35.210 --> 02:36.040
Princess.

02:40.280 --> 02:41.150
Pierre...

02:42.320 --> 02:43.550
I knew it!

02:45.090 --> 02:48.560
Danger! Date at the Aquarium.

02:53.130 --> 02:54.000
Huh?

02:54.000 --> 02:55.110
Is Vanilla not done yet?

02:56.460 --> 02:56.860
Hey.

03:00.070 --> 03:00.760
Pierre.

03:01.340 --> 03:03.260
So, do you hate fish?

03:04.910 --> 03:07.810
Well, salmon is nice, with a cream sauce or...

03:07.810 --> 03:10.000
Not that... Living fish.

03:10.880 --> 03:12.480
If you'd like, do you want to go to the aquarium?

03:13.650 --> 03:15.520
Along with the Members, right?

03:16.080 --> 03:17.520
No, just the two of us.

03:19.920 --> 03:22.930
I'd like to go on a date with you tomorrow.

03:23.490 --> 03:24.890
D-Date?

03:26.700 --> 03:27.430
Pierre.

03:28.230 --> 03:29.430
Chocolat-chan...

03:31.600 --> 03:33.830
Okay, I'll be wait for you at the park at noon.

03:35.540 --> 03:37.190
Chocolat-chan!

03:38.970 --> 03:39.840
Are you okay?

03:40.780 --> 03:42.480
What did Pierre say to you?

03:43.580 --> 03:44.780
He asked me on a date.

03:47.350 --> 03:50.420
This time, I'm gonna take Pierre's heart, for sure.

03:50.420 --> 03:54.360
And I'll find out whether he's really an Ogre.

03:54.360 --> 03:56.230
Chocolat-chan, that's dangerous.

03:57.190 --> 03:59.530
Don't tell Robin or Houx, okay?

03:59.530 --> 04:01.860
Don't do it! You can't go, no way!

04:01.860 --> 04:07.670
If Pierre is really an Ogre, and
he takes your heart, you might die!

04:07.670 --> 04:08.570
Don't worry.

04:09.200 --> 04:11.100
He ain't gonna take my heart.

04:11.740 --> 04:14.230
'Cause I'm gonna take his!

04:15.580 --> 04:16.610
It's weird, Chocolat.

04:17.180 --> 04:19.950
When it comes to Pierre,
you get so stubborn!

04:19.950 --> 04:21.650
I'm not being stubborn!

04:21.650 --> 04:22.450
Yes, you are!

04:23.790 --> 04:25.450
Just be quiet, leave me alone!

04:27.490 --> 04:29.520
This is my problem.

04:29.520 --> 04:31.160
You don't have anything to do with it, Vanilla.

04:31.790 --> 04:32.890
Chocolat-chan...

04:32.890 --> 04:35.250
I'm just worried about you, Chocolat-chan.

04:35.560 --> 04:36.960
Fine, just leave me alone!

04:39.030 --> 04:40.920
Chocolat-chan, you jerk!

04:45.410 --> 04:46.140
Vanilla...

04:50.980 --> 04:53.370
Is Vanilla still angry, I wonder?

04:54.520 --> 04:58.090
I get that Vanilla is worried about me, but...

04:59.450 --> 05:00.190
Maybe...

05:07.200 --> 05:10.130
I really am stubborn.

05:10.830 --> 05:12.430
Vanilla is exactly right!

05:13.070 --> 05:14.770
Pierre is dangerous...

05:14.770 --> 05:16.170
Don't go on that date!

05:18.170 --> 05:19.670
She's not listening.

05:20.710 --> 05:23.280
Will Chocolat-chan go no matter what?

05:23.280 --> 05:25.650
Just leave that Chocolat alone.

05:26.150 --> 05:29.380
We should take this as a good opportunity!

05:29.850 --> 05:32.190
Don't say that, Blanca.

05:32.190 --> 05:36.390
I've been saved by
Chocolat-chan ever since I was little.

05:37.160 --> 05:38.690
From that dragon,

05:38.690 --> 05:40.930
bullies...

05:42.500 --> 05:45.330
I'm just a crybaby with no friends,

05:45.330 --> 05:47.730
but Chocolat-chan always encouraged me.

05:48.800 --> 05:52.110
But Chocolat-chan is in danger right now.

05:53.010 --> 05:54.340
What should I do?

05:54.880 --> 05:57.310
How can I save Chocolat-chan?

05:58.750 --> 05:59.650
That's it!

05:59.650 --> 06:01.750
There's got to be something in the
Magical World Mail Order Catalogue!

06:07.520 --> 06:09.020
Alright, perfect!

06:12.690 --> 06:14.460
I think so, anyway.

06:14.460 --> 06:16.900
Don't go, Chocolat!

06:16.900 --> 06:17.900
It's dangerous!

06:18.600 --> 06:22.440
Duke, do you have some sort of
secret weapon I can use against Pierre?

06:22.440 --> 06:24.910
Like, to power up my charm, or something?

06:25.440 --> 06:27.410
Aren't you listening to me?

06:28.210 --> 06:30.950
I don't know how to increase your charm!

06:30.950 --> 06:33.650
You should just do something with your own magic!

06:34.350 --> 06:35.320
Magic?

06:35.820 --> 06:36.650
That's it!

06:37.290 --> 06:39.790
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

06:45.130 --> 06:46.120
Wand!

06:56.360 --> 06:57.430
Alright!

06:57.940 --> 07:01.980
This jewel of Padparadsha,
and the sparkling Brillant Etoile.

07:01.980 --> 07:04.240
Make my hair and lips shine!

07:04.850 --> 07:06.370
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

07:06.650 --> 07:07.880
Brillant Etoile!

07:12.150 --> 07:16.360
And then, the watermelon tourmaline,

07:16.360 --> 07:18.690
Fleur Spirale, Spiral of Flowers!

07:25.070 --> 07:28.140
Alright! Now I'm gonna win!

07:28.900 --> 07:31.180
Wait! I won't let you go!

07:31.510 --> 07:32.510
Duke...

07:41.350 --> 07:42.050
Huh?

07:46.890 --> 07:47.570
Vanilla...

07:48.660 --> 07:51.460
It's perfume with the power of protection.

07:51.460 --> 07:56.580
I really wish you wouldn't go,
but I know you'll go no matter what.

07:56.580 --> 07:59.070
So at least, take this with you.

08:03.400 --> 08:04.770
It smells like violets.

08:06.140 --> 08:07.840
Gentle, like Vanilla.

08:10.180 --> 08:11.580
Thank you, Vanilla.

08:13.120 --> 08:15.080
Hey, Chocolat!

08:15.820 --> 08:18.100
Let me out!

08:22.490 --> 08:23.990
That girl is really cute.

08:24.630 --> 08:27.790
Even if Pierre is an Ogre,
there's no way I'm gonna lose!

08:27.790 --> 08:31.520
With the Brillant Etoile and
Vanilla's perfume, it'll be a cinch!

08:46.350 --> 08:47.780
Over here, over here!

08:48.980 --> 08:49.780
Pierre...

08:50.790 --> 08:51.250
Huh?

08:52.350 --> 08:54.150
Huh? He's playing with those kids with water?

09:00.430 --> 09:00.930
Hey.

09:06.430 --> 09:07.340
See ya!

09:07.340 --> 09:08.150
Bye-bye!

09:14.780 --> 09:18.510
Pierre... He's cool looking in his normal clothes too.

09:21.750 --> 09:23.850
You really seem to be sparkling today.

09:24.350 --> 09:25.090
Really?

09:25.660 --> 09:28.960
And you smell like gentle violets.

09:29.290 --> 09:31.130
Shoot, my hearts beating faster...

09:31.130 --> 09:33.730
I came here to find out Pierre's true identity.

09:34.300 --> 09:36.970
And more than that, to take his heart!

09:37.330 --> 09:38.030
Shall we go?

09:41.100 --> 09:42.940
He's nicer than usual?

09:43.700 --> 09:45.140
Because of the magic?

09:57.790 --> 09:59.290
Arabian angel fish,

10:00.390 --> 10:01.920
orange-spotted stingray,

10:03.660 --> 10:04.560
red arowana...

10:06.460 --> 10:10.590
Once these fish choose a partner,

10:11.230 --> 10:12.870
they never seperate.

10:12.870 --> 10:15.880
If one of them dies, the other
one is always alone until it dies.

10:17.440 --> 10:19.240
Don't you think that's beautiful?

10:26.430 --> 10:28.650
Uh... I've got to go to the bathroom!

10:30.890 --> 10:32.940
That was close...

10:33.420 --> 10:37.190
My face was red, and my
heart was beating fast again.

10:38.060 --> 10:40.700
Maybe I'll use Brillant Etoile again!

10:42.960 --> 10:44.060
Prince...

10:45.770 --> 10:48.170
I'm happy that we ran into each other.

10:48.940 --> 10:51.210
Yurika, and everyone as well...

10:51.210 --> 10:54.710
This is good timing.
We were all on our way to my house.

10:55.340 --> 10:59.980
My father bought me a new
horse, and we're having a debut party.

11:00.720 --> 11:03.050
Of course you'll come, won't you?

11:03.050 --> 11:04.690
Please, Prince.

11:04.690 --> 11:05.920
Won't you come?

11:07.050 --> 11:08.020
I can't, Yurika.

11:08.560 --> 11:09.920
Not today.

11:11.660 --> 11:13.190
I see.

11:13.690 --> 11:17.330
Is it that you're in the
middle of a date with someone?

11:20.740 --> 11:21.900
Yurika...

11:22.400 --> 11:24.340
How could you, Prince?

11:24.340 --> 11:27.430
To think like that about Chocolat Kato...

11:30.320 --> 11:32.190
The black hearts of jealousy.

11:33.580 --> 11:38.890
My, you all get jealous so quickly.

11:44.690 --> 11:45.660
Blocus!

11:54.800 --> 11:55.860
Sanction!

12:01.310 --> 12:03.700
He took those black hearts!

12:04.250 --> 12:09.680
Why? But Duke said if you
take black hearts, you get injured...

12:10.720 --> 12:15.960
There is no more powerful energy of
human feelings than jealousy and hatred.

12:19.160 --> 12:23.560
Even if you collect rouge or rose,
they don't compare to the noir hearts.

12:23.560 --> 12:25.720
Well, they're better than nothing, I guess.

12:26.270 --> 12:27.100
In the end...

12:28.170 --> 12:28.940
In the end...

12:29.840 --> 12:31.810
I didn't think it could be, but...

12:33.140 --> 12:36.000
Pierre actually did come from the Magical World.

12:37.310 --> 12:38.650
Speaking of which, Chocolat...

12:39.410 --> 12:41.030
I'll take your heart as well.

12:44.050 --> 12:45.690
I'll never give it to you!

13:03.400 --> 13:06.610
Pierre, you're a magic user too, aren't you?

13:06.610 --> 13:09.480
I thought you realized it long ago, Chocolat.

13:09.480 --> 13:12.510
Since you're one the current Queen Candidates.

13:12.510 --> 13:14.450
Of course I noticed!

13:15.320 --> 13:19.550
That cold atmosphere, I felt it the first time we met.

13:19.550 --> 13:21.050
That smell of rain in the Magical World.

13:22.260 --> 13:24.960
When you compare it with that kind face
he had playing with those kids back then,

13:24.960 --> 13:26.990
he seems like a different person.

13:27.290 --> 13:30.830
I came on this date to take your heart!

13:32.370 --> 13:33.600
You say some funny things.

13:34.470 --> 13:38.970
An inexperienced witch like you, taking my heart?

13:39.910 --> 13:42.010
And that heart doesn't exist in the first place.

13:42.010 --> 13:43.980
How exactly do you plan on taking it?

13:46.610 --> 13:49.580
I don't feel anything for you.

13:52.920 --> 13:55.660
So all that acting all lovey-dovey before...

13:55.660 --> 13:58.230
It was all an act! That pisses me off!

13:58.630 --> 14:00.990
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

14:02.860 --> 14:04.300
Brilliant Etoile!

14:09.770 --> 14:13.470
My eyes, my hair, my lips... Max Sparkle!

14:15.010 --> 14:16.740
This isn't normal light, either.

14:17.340 --> 14:20.240
It'll stir up your heart! It'll have an effect!

14:20.980 --> 14:21.820
How's that?

14:26.290 --> 14:27.690
Sorry to disappoint you,
but it doesn't work.

14:29.360 --> 14:29.970
Ready?

14:30.660 --> 14:32.960
If you want magic, this is how it's done.

14:33.830 --> 14:35.300
Efficase Voix!

14:40.300 --> 14:43.500
This is a special love magic I'm giving you.

14:44.770 --> 14:48.240
You'll love me more and more this way.

14:48.840 --> 14:51.970
It's like he's whispering directly into my ear...

14:51.970 --> 14:55.150
Chocolat, come closer to me.

14:57.120 --> 14:59.620
I really love you.

15:00.190 --> 15:02.690
Liar. I'll never believe you!

15:03.490 --> 15:06.260
I want to fall asleep, burying my face in your hair...

15:07.600 --> 15:11.230
It's like a feather is tickling my heart.

15:13.070 --> 15:16.240
I just want to give you a kiss. May I?

15:18.980 --> 15:22.080
This is bad... Really bad!

15:23.780 --> 15:26.150
Here, can you see? It's your heart.

15:27.650 --> 15:29.080
It's already this orange.

15:30.650 --> 15:31.580
Oh, no!

15:32.750 --> 15:34.580
I'll take it when it becomes pink.

15:34.860 --> 15:37.730
I've got to get out of this barrier somehow.

15:37.730 --> 15:40.870
Magic... Is there some magic I can use?

15:41.200 --> 15:41.790
That's it!

15:42.400 --> 15:44.600
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

15:45.630 --> 15:46.870
Fleur Spirale!

15:48.670 --> 15:50.360
Rosemary that will peer into the darkness...

15:50.940 --> 15:53.570
If it can break Pierre's spell just a bit...

15:55.140 --> 15:56.340
Flowers and light?

15:57.140 --> 16:03.050
You actually thought that you could
take my heart with something like that?

16:03.820 --> 16:04.680
That's cute.

16:05.690 --> 16:06.520
But pointless.

16:07.590 --> 16:08.860
Jalousie Aiguille!

16:11.660 --> 16:12.860
What was that just now?

16:13.890 --> 16:15.800
The needles of jealousy.

16:15.800 --> 16:18.870
Those needles will line your heart with jealousy.

16:19.330 --> 16:21.140
I'm not like that!

16:21.140 --> 16:22.870
That magic's not gonna work on me!

16:23.300 --> 16:23.870
Yurika.

16:31.010 --> 16:33.050
Yurika, are you okay?

16:34.320 --> 16:36.820
What... are these feelings?

16:39.850 --> 16:43.690
I'm sorry. I've gotten you, my
darling, involved in this battle.

16:44.490 --> 16:46.020
My cute Yurika...

16:46.460 --> 16:49.600
Stop it... Don't be so nice to Yurika...

16:50.430 --> 16:53.370
Why? Why am I suffering like this?

16:54.340 --> 16:57.040
It's like deep black thorns of jealousy.

16:57.810 --> 17:03.080
Please, don't get close to, or
talk to, any girl besides me...

17:04.740 --> 17:06.080
You don't like it?

17:06.080 --> 17:09.320
I don't... I don't like it at all.

17:10.180 --> 17:12.420
I want you to look only at me!

17:19.190 --> 17:21.420
That was quick. It's now pink.

17:24.430 --> 17:25.440
No!

17:26.000 --> 17:29.840
A witch's heart is many thousands of
times more resistant than a human's.

17:30.840 --> 17:32.840
Therefore the power it holds is, as well.

17:33.770 --> 17:34.970
I'll take it.

17:35.540 --> 17:37.950
Why are you doing this?

17:37.950 --> 17:38.970
Because you're an Ogre?

17:40.550 --> 17:41.580
Sanction!

17:46.550 --> 17:48.690
My heart was taken so simply...

17:51.260 --> 17:54.210
Is this how I die?

18:00.130 --> 18:01.500
But, it feels good.

18:13.380 --> 18:16.720
This is strange, where did Chocolat-chan go?

18:17.250 --> 18:19.240
She doesn't seem to be anywhere, Vanilla.

18:20.090 --> 18:23.490
You're sure Chocolat said
she was going to the aquarium?

18:24.460 --> 18:26.960
Man, what are we going to do with her?

18:27.490 --> 18:31.960
I'm sorry, I should have told you two earlier.

18:33.730 --> 18:37.940
That scent, it's that violet perfume I gave Chocolat.

18:39.710 --> 18:40.470
That's...

18:41.280 --> 18:42.240
I've found it!

18:49.750 --> 18:50.740
Stop!

18:51.120 --> 18:53.920
No way. My barrier was broken that easily?

18:54.920 --> 18:57.550
However, I won't allow any familiar to get in my way!

18:59.130 --> 18:59.960
Chocolat!

19:00.700 --> 19:02.120
Feuilles D'epee!

19:07.900 --> 19:09.470
Royaume's knights, huh?

19:10.170 --> 19:11.240
The Feuilles D'epee...

19:11.240 --> 19:12.340
He blocked it with his hand!

19:25.720 --> 19:26.420
Chocolat!

19:29.360 --> 19:31.460
You won't get away, you Ogre!

19:31.460 --> 19:33.360
Don't come near Chocolat again!

19:34.090 --> 19:38.970
We, the Ogres, shall rise
again. And we will crush Royaume!

19:39.930 --> 19:41.970
I won't let you people interfere!

19:43.340 --> 19:45.670
Obscurite Crystallization!

19:47.110 --> 19:49.380
Crap, Mur de Lierre!

19:55.420 --> 19:58.520
You need to realize the true power of noir.

19:59.420 --> 20:00.250
Don't do it!

20:02.060 --> 20:04.560
Pierre Tempete du Neige!

20:15.000 --> 20:16.240
Chocolat-chan!

20:25.380 --> 20:27.310
Why do you know my true name?

20:28.550 --> 20:29.720
Could it be, you're...

20:31.990 --> 20:33.330
Thank you, Duke.

20:33.690 --> 20:34.550
Chocolat!

20:34.550 --> 20:35.090
Stand back!

20:35.090 --> 20:36.040
Stop it!

20:36.460 --> 20:41.090
No matter what happens, I'll never like you again!

20:45.270 --> 20:47.770
Yay! You got dumped by Chocolat!

20:47.770 --> 20:51.470
If you don't stop aiming for
Chocolat, you'll just get embarrassed.

20:52.890 --> 20:54.520
Jerk!

20:56.410 --> 20:59.110
Why are we in this place?

21:00.350 --> 21:01.810
Thank goodness, Chocolat-chan!

21:02.580 --> 21:03.850
I'm sorry, Vanilla.

21:08.790 --> 21:09.790
Prince...

21:15.660 --> 21:19.270
Man, if I hadn't have had that perfume
you gave me, I would have been in trouble.

21:19.970 --> 21:22.290
I'm glad it was helpful.

21:22.900 --> 21:26.030
So Pierre's magic was that strong, huh?

21:26.840 --> 21:30.030
Is that the power of the Ogres' noir?

21:30.640 --> 21:35.010
It seems like Pierre despises our Royaume.

21:36.250 --> 21:38.150
Because he's an Ogre?

21:38.150 --> 21:40.690
Because he's our enemy?

21:40.690 --> 21:43.520
But... I wonder why?

21:45.690 --> 21:49.030
Oh yeah, Duke. What did you say to Pierre?

21:50.050 --> 21:52.570
N-No thing...

21:53.400 --> 21:55.900
Maybe you knew him?

21:55.900 --> 21:56.540
You got me!

21:57.540 --> 22:01.540
If I say, I'll be cursed, and
I won't be able to talk anymore!

22:01.540 --> 22:04.540
I'll turn into a real frog!

22:06.010 --> 22:07.480
I'm hungry!

22:07.480 --> 22:08.610
Let's hurry up and go home!

22:09.520 --> 22:11.250
Don't dodge the question!

22:23.120 --> 22:29.450
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.540 --> 22:30.950
"Love"

22:31.860 --> 22:35.370
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.780
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.210 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.960 --> 23:00.230
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.830 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.200 --> 23:11.270
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.640 --> 23:16.080
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.080 --> 23:26.190
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.250 --> 23:35.160
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:45.610 --> 23:48.230
Yup, Pierre was an Ogre after all.

23:48.230 --> 23:51.300
I won't forgive him for aiming for my heart.

23:51.300 --> 23:54.980
I'll never going to get swept up by Pierre again!

23:54.980 --> 23:56.660
But what exactly is an Ogre?

23:57.390 --> 24:01.600
Okay, I'm going to do some deep research into Ogres!

24:01.600 --> 24:03.530
But how can I?

24:03.530 --> 24:06.200
If I just go back to the Magical World by myself, I'll be disqualified.

24:06.820 --> 24:08.800
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.800 --> 24:11.800
The Creating of the Magical World, The Secret of th Ogres.

24:11.800 --> 24:13.800
Tell me, Queen Candy!
